This repository is a reproduction of the method described in:

  Search-R1: Training LLMs to Reason and Leverage Search Engines with
  Reinforcement Learning (Bowen Jin et al., COLM 2025, arXiv:2503.09516)
  Code: https://github.com/PeterGriffinJin/Search-R1

The reproduction code in this repository was written independently.
Please cite both this repository and the original Search-R1 paper.
